<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - RF Micro Devices a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - RF Micro Devices a buy.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hambrecht &amp; Quist started coverage of RF Micro Devices Inc with a buy rating based on its position as a component supplier to wireless communications markets including cellular, personal communications services, wireless local loop phone service and wireless local area networking for computers.</p>
<p>-- estimates the company will earn $0.44/shr on revenue of $52.7 million in 1998, rising to $0.66/shr on revenue of $98.7 million in 1999.</p>
</text>
